---
description: UnityScraper project conventions
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md at the repository root for setup, layout and rules.

- Put new code in `unityscraper/domains` (business logic) or `unityscraper/app`
  (desktop, CLI, API adapters); keep legacy top-level module names working.
- Validate with `python -m ruff check .`, `python -m compileall -q .`,
  `python -m tests.test_unityscraper` and `python -m tests.test_integration`
  from the repository root.
- Migrations are additive; unit tests never hit XboxUnity or wikis live.
